@startuml
' 参加者定義
participant Client
participant AuthService
participant Server
participant DB

' ── 認証処理 ──
group 認証
  Client -> AuthService: login(username, password)
  activate AuthService
  AuthService --> Client: token
  deactivate AuthService
end group

' ── リソースアクセスを繰り返し ──
loop リソースアクセスを繰り返す
  Client -> Server: GET /resource\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  activate Server
  alt token 有効
    Server -> DB: SELECT * FROM resource
    activate DB
    DB --> Server: data
    deactivate DB
    Server --> Client: 200 OK + data
  else token 無効
    Server --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
    break
  end
  deactivate Server
end

' ── ログアウト（オプション） ──
opt ログアウト
  Client -> Server: POST /logout\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  activate Server
  Server --> AuthService: invalidate(token)
  activate AuthService
  AuthService --> Server: OK
  deactivate AuthService
  Server --> Client: 200 OK
  deactivate Server
end

@enduml
